# Never commit real secrets. The `.env*` glob is broad on purpose, but the
# `.env.example` templates must stay tracked — they contain placeholders only
# and are what a new contributor copies to `.env`.
.env
.env*
!.env.example
!**/.env.example

# Database backups (npm run backup:db) hold every student's personal data. Never commit one.
backend/backups/
*.backup.json.gz
